<section class="sec" id="platforms"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="eyebrow">Works on your setup</div>
  <h2>Every platform, every graphics card</h2>
  <p class="intro">Most clip tools support one system, or one brand of GPU. rewynd is native on all three platforms and encodes on whatever card you have. That's what sets it apart.</p>
  <div class="cards3">
    <div class="card"><h3 class="big">Windows</h3><p>Windows 10 / 11 · NVIDIA · AMD · Intel<br />One-click installer, no admin rights needed.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><h3 class="big">Linux</h3><p>NVIDIA · AMD · Intel<br />Self-updating AppImage, works on any distro.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><h3 class="big">macOS</h3><p>Apple Silicon<br />macOS 15 or newer.</p></div>
  </div>
  <div class="secnote">Your GPU does the encoding on all of them, so gameplay stays smooth.</div>
</div></section>
